{"html":"<div class=\"app\"><div class=\"doc-layout\"><nav class=\"sidebar\"><a href=\"/\" class=\"sidebar-wordmark\"><img class=\"sidebar-mark\" src=\"/loon-bird.svg\" alt=\"\"><span>loon</span></a><div class=\"sidebar-section\"><p class=\"sidebar-section-label\">Learn</p><div><a href=\"/tour\" class=\"sidebar-link\">Tour</a><a class=\"sidebar-link\" href=\"/install\">Installation</a><a href=\"/examples\" class=\"sidebar-link\">By Example</a></div></div><div class=\"sidebar-section\"><p class=\"sidebar-section-label\">Guide</p><div><a class=\"sidebar-link\" href=\"/guide/basics\">Basics</a><a class=\"sidebar-link\" href=\"/guide/functions\">Functions</a><a href=\"/guide/types\" class=\"sidebar-link\">Types</a><a href=\"/guide/collections\" class=\"sidebar-link\">Collections</a><a href=\"/guide/pattern-matching\" class=\"sidebar-link\">Pattern Matching</a><a href=\"/guide/ownership\" class=\"sidebar-link\">Ownership</a><a href=\"/guide/effects\" class=\"sidebar-link\">Effects</a><a href=\"/guide/modules\" class=\"sidebar-link\">Modules</a><a class=\"sidebar-link\" href=\"/guide/macros\">Macros</a><a class=\"sidebar-link\" href=\"/guide/testing\">Testing</a><a href=\"/guide/errors\" class=\"sidebar-link\">Error Handling</a></div></div><div class=\"sidebar-section\"><p class=\"sidebar-section-label\">Reference</p><div><a href=\"/ref/syntax\" class=\"sidebar-link\">Syntax</a><a href=\"/ref/builtins\" class=\"sidebar-link\">Builtins</a><a href=\"/ref/cli\" class=\"sidebar-link\">CLI</a><a class=\"sidebar-link\" href=\"/ref/effects\">Standard Effects</a><a class=\"sidebar-link\" href=\"/ref/lsp\">LSP</a><a class=\"sidebar-link\" href=\"/ref/formatter\">Formatter</a></div></div><div class=\"sidebar-section\"><p class=\"sidebar-section-label\">Concepts</p><div><a href=\"/concepts/invisible-types\" class=\"sidebar-link\">Why Invisible Types</a><a class=\"sidebar-link\" href=\"/concepts/effects\">Understanding Effects</a><a class=\"sidebar-link\" href=\"/concepts/ownership\">Ownership Mental Model</a><a class=\"sidebar-link\" href=\"/concepts/from-rust\">Coming from Rust</a><a class=\"sidebar-link\" href=\"/concepts/from-js\">Coming from JS/TS</a><a href=\"/concepts/from-clojure\" class=\"sidebar-link\">Coming from Clojure</a></div></div><div class=\"sidebar-section\"><p class=\"sidebar-section-label\">Playground</p><div><a class=\"sidebar-link sidebar-link-active\" href=\"/play\">Playground</a></div></div><div class=\"sidebar-section\"><p class=\"sidebar-section-label\">Project</p><div><a href=\"/changelog\" class=\"sidebar-link\">Changelog</a><a href=\"/roadmap\" class=\"sidebar-link\">Roadmap</a><a target=\"_blank\" class=\"sidebar-link\" href=\"https://github.com/ecto/loon\">GitHub</a></div></div></nav><div class=\"doc-content\"><div class=\"page\"><main style=\"padding: 3rem 0\"><h1 style=\"font-family: 'IBM Plex Serif', Georgia, 'Times New Roman', serif; font-size: 2.5rem; margin-bottom: 0.5rem; color: var(--fg)\">Playground</h1><p style=\"color: var(--muted); margin-bottom: 2rem\">Write and run Loon in your browser. This page is itself written in Loon.</p><div class=\"editor-wrapper\"><div class=\"editor-toolbar\"><span class=\"editor-title\">Loon Playground</span><button class=\"cta-button editor-run\">Run</button></div><div class=\"editor-body\"><div class=\"editor-input\"><textarea spellcheck=\"false\" class=\"editor-textarea\" id=\"playground-editor\" placeholder=\"; Write Loon code here...\">; Try some Loon!\n\n[type Shape [Circle f64] [Rect f64 f64] Point]\n\n[fn area [shape]\n  [match shape\n    [Circle r] [* 3.14159 [* r r]]\n    [Rect w h] [* w h]\n    Point 0.0]]\n\n[each [fn [s] [println [str s \" \" [area s]]]]\n  #[[Circle 5.0] [Rect 3.0 4.0] Point]]</textarea></div><div class=\"editor-output-panel\"><div class=\"editor-output-label\">Output</div><pre class=\"editor-output\" id=\"playground-output\">; Click Run to evaluate</pre></div></div></div><div style=\"margin-top: 2rem\"><h3 style=\"font-size: 1.3rem; color: var(--fg); margin-bottom: 1rem; font-family: 'IBM Plex Serif', Georgia, 'Times New Roman', serif\">Examples</h3><div style=\"gap: 1rem; display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr\"><div class=\"card\" style=\"padding: 2rem 0; border-top: 1px solid var(--border)\"><div><h4 style=\"margin-bottom: 0.5rem; font-family: 'IBM Plex Serif', Georgia, 'Times New Roman', serif; color: var(--fg)\">Hello World</h4><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\"><pre class=\"code-block\"><code class=\"language-loon\"><span class=\"syntax-paren\">[</span><span class=\"syntax-builtin\">println</span> <span class=\"syntax-string\">\"Hello, world!\"</span><span class=\"syntax-paren\">]</span></code></pre></div></div></div><div class=\"card\" style=\"border-top: 1px solid var(--border); padding: 2rem 0\"><div><h4 style=\"color: var(--fg); font-family: 'IBM Plex Serif', Georgia, 'Times New Roman', serif; margin-bottom: 0.5rem\">Fibonacci</h4><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\"><pre class=\"code-block\"><code class=\"language-loon\"><span class=\"syntax-paren\">[</span><span class=\"syntax-keyword\">fn</span> fib <span class=\"syntax-paren\">[</span>n<span class=\"syntax-paren\">]</span>\n  <span class=\"syntax-paren\">[</span><span class=\"syntax-keyword\">match</span> n\n    <span class=\"syntax-number\">0</span> <span class=\"syntax-number\">0</span>  <span class=\"syntax-number\">1</span> <span class=\"syntax-number\">1</span>\n    _ <span class=\"syntax-paren\">[</span><span class=\"syntax-builtin\">+</span> <span class=\"syntax-paren\">[</span>fib <span class=\"syntax-paren\">[</span><span class=\"syntax-builtin\">-</span> n <span class=\"syntax-number\">1</span><span class=\"syntax-paren\">]</span><span class=\"syntax-paren\">]</span>\n            <span class=\"syntax-paren\">[</span>fib <span class=\"syntax-paren\">[</span><span class=\"syntax-builtin\">-</span> n <span class=\"syntax-number\">2</span><span class=\"syntax-paren\">]</span><span class=\"syntax-paren\">]</span><span class=\"syntax-paren\">]</span><span class=\"syntax-paren\">]</span><span class=\"syntax-paren\">]</span>\n<span class=\"syntax-paren\">[</span>fib <span class=\"syntax-number\">10</span><span class=\"syntax-paren\">]</span></code></pre></div></div></div><div class=\"card\" style=\"border-top: 1px solid var(--border); padding: 2rem 0\"><div><h4 style=\"color: var(--fg); margin-bottom: 0.5rem; font-family: 'IBM Plex Serif', Georgia, 'Times New Roman', serif\">Effects</h4><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\"><pre class=\"code-block\"><code class=\"language-loon\"><span class=\"syntax-paren\">[</span><span class=\"syntax-keyword\">effect</span> <span class=\"syntax-function\">Ask</span>\n  <span class=\"syntax-paren\">[</span><span class=\"syntax-keyword\">fn</span> question <span class=\"syntax-paren\">[</span>q<span class=\"syntax-paren\">]</span><span class=\"syntax-paren\">]</span><span class=\"syntax-paren\">]</span>\n\n<span class=\"syntax-paren\">[</span><span class=\"syntax-keyword\">handle</span>\n  <span class=\"syntax-paren\">[</span><span class=\"syntax-function\">Ask.question</span> <span class=\"syntax-string\">\"name?\"</span><span class=\"syntax-paren\">]</span>\n  <span class=\"syntax-paren\">[</span><span class=\"syntax-function\">Ask.question</span> q<span class=\"syntax-paren\">]</span>\n    <span class=\"syntax-paren\">[</span>resume <span class=\"syntax-string\">\"Loon\"</span><span class=\"syntax-paren\">]</span><span class=\"syntax-paren\">]</span></code></pre></div></div></div><div class=\"card\" style=\"padding: 2rem 0; border-top: 1px solid var(--border)\"><div><h4 style=\"color: var(--fg); font-family: 'IBM Plex Serif', Georgia, 'Times New Roman', serif; margin-bottom: 0.5rem\">Pipelines</h4><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\"><pre class=\"code-block\"><code class=\"language-loon\"><span class=\"syntax-paren\">[</span><span class=\"syntax-keyword\">pipe</span> <span class=\"syntax-paren\">[</span><span class=\"syntax-builtin\">range</span> <span class=\"syntax-number\">1</span> <span class=\"syntax-number\">100</span><span class=\"syntax-paren\">]</span>\n  <span class=\"syntax-paren\">[</span><span class=\"syntax-builtin\">filter</span> <span class=\"syntax-paren\">[</span><span class=\"syntax-keyword\">fn</span> <span class=\"syntax-paren\">[</span>n<span class=\"syntax-paren\">]</span> <span class=\"syntax-paren\">[</span><span class=\"syntax-builtin\">=</span> <span class=\"syntax-number\">0</span> <span class=\"syntax-paren\">[</span><span class=\"syntax-builtin\">%</span> n <span class=\"syntax-number\">3</span><span class=\"syntax-paren\">]</span><span class=\"syntax-paren\">]</span><span class=\"syntax-paren\">]</span><span class=\"syntax-paren\">]</span>\n  <span class=\"syntax-paren\">[</span><span class=\"syntax-builtin\">map</span> <span class=\"syntax-paren\">[</span><span class=\"syntax-keyword\">fn</span> <span class=\"syntax-paren\">[</span>n<span class=\"syntax-paren\">]</span> <span class=\"syntax-paren\">[</span><span class=\"syntax-builtin\">*</span> n n<span class=\"syntax-paren\">]</span><span class=\"syntax-paren\">]</span><span class=\"syntax-paren\">]</span>\n  <span class=\"syntax-paren\">[</span><span class=\"syntax-builtin\">take</span> <span class=\"syntax-number\">5</span><span class=\"syntax-paren\">]</span><span class=\"syntax-paren\">]</span></code></pre></div></div></div></div></div></main></div><footer class=\"footer\" style=\"display: flex; margin-top: 2rem; align-items: center; padding: 3rem 0; gap: 1.5rem\"><span style=\"font-size: 0.78rem; letter-spacing: 0.1em; font-family: 'IBM Plex Mono', ui-monospace, 'SFMono-Regular', monospace; color: var(--muted)\">loon</span><a target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://github.com/ecto/loon\" style=\"text-decoration: none; color: var(--muted); font-family: 'IBM Plex Mono', ui-monospace, 'SFMono-Regular', monospace; font-size: 0.78rem; letter-spacing: 0.05em\">GitHub</a><a target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://github.com/ecto/loon/blob/main/LICENSE\" style=\"text-decoration: none; color: var(--muted); font-family: 'IBM Plex Mono', ui-monospace, 'SFMono-Regular', monospace; font-size: 0.78rem; letter-spacing: 0.05em\">MIT License</a></footer></div></div></div>","title":null}
